// Section 56A(c), 59(k) aggregation and groups, 57(b), 59(a)(3)(A) (stage 3).
// NOT EXECUTED in this assignment (status implemented_unverified). Expectations are
// computed by hand from the pinned statutory text, not from any engine output.
// Index values (C-CPI-U, CPI) in scenarios are SYNTHETIC round numbers chosen for hand
// arithmetic; they are not Bureau of Labor Statistics data.

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package us.irc.income_individual version "0.1.1";
namespace "urn:us:irc:income_individual:clir";

test "S56A-C-01-AFSI-BEFORE-NOL-IS-STATEMENT-PLUS-ADJUSTMENTS" {
    given {
        context {
            legal_time @2024-12-31;
            decision_time @2024-12-31T09:00:00-05:00;
            knowledge_time @2024-12-31T09:00:00-05:00;
            timezone "America/New_York";
            deadline_policy us.irc.core::IRC_CALENDAR_STEP;
        }
        assert "f0": us.irc.core::calendar_year_of(entity_ref("urn:test:s66#y"), 2024) { origin case_input; }
        assert "f1": applicable_financial_statement_net_income(entity_ref("urn:test:s66#corp"), entity_ref("urn:test:s66#y"), 1000000 USD) { origin case_input; }
        assert "f2": taxes_disregarded_on_statement(entity_ref("urn:test:s66#corp"), entity_ref("urn:test:s66#y"), 200000 USD) { origin case_input; }
        assert "f3": depreciation_allowed_168_property_for_taxable_income(entity_ref("urn:test:s66#corp"), entity_ref("urn:test:s66#y"), 80000 USD) { origin case_input; }
        assert "f4": depreciation_expense_on_statement(entity_ref("urn:test:s66#corp"), entity_ref("urn:test:s66#y"), 50000 USD) { origin case_input; }
    }
    // 1000000 + taxes 200000 + depreciation (50000 - 80000)
    evaluate truth(afsi_before_nol_deduction(entity_ref("urn:test:s66#corp"), entity_ref("urn:test:s66#y"), 1170000 USD));
    expect truth_status == TRUE_ONLY;
    expect evaluation_status == COMPUTED;
}

